     "title": "📖 اسمع وردّد",
     "html": "<div class=\"quran qx\" data-q=\"96:1-20\" data-h=\"1-19\"><div class=\"qbasm\">بِسْمِ ࡴ۬للَّهِ ࡴ۬لرَّحْمَٰنِ ࡴ۬لرَّحِيمِ</div><span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"1\" data-h=\"1-1\">ࡴٜقْرَأْ بِاسْمِ رَبِّكَ ࡰ۬لذِے خَلَقَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"2\" data-h=\"2-2\">خَلَقَ ࡰ۬لْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"3\" data-h=\"3-3\">ࡴٜقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ࡰ۬لْأَكْرَمُ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٣﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"4\" data-h=\"4-4\">ࡲ۬لذِے عَلَّمَ بِالْقَلَمِ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٤﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"5\" data-h=\"5-5\">عَلَّمَ ࡰ۬لْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٥﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"6\" data-h=\"6-6\">كَلَّا إِنَّ ࡰ۬لْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٦﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"7\" data-h=\"7-7\">أَن رَّءَاهُ ࡲٜسْتَغْنَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٧﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"8\" data-h=\"8-8\">إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ࡰ۬لرُّجْعَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٨﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"9\" data-h=\"9-9\">أَرَٰ۬يْتَ ࡰ۬لذِے يَنْهَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٩﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"10\" data-h=\"10-10\">عَبْداً إِذَا صَلَّىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٠﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"11\" data-h=\"11-11\">أَرَٰ۬يْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ࡰ۬لْهُدَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١١﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"12\" data-h=\"12-12\">أَوْ أَمَرَ بِالتَّقْوَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٢﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"13\" data-h=\"13-13\">أَرَٰ۬يْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٣﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"14\" data-h=\"14-14\">أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ࡰ۬للَّهَ يَرَىٰ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٤﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"15\" data-h=\"15-15\">كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٥﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"16\" data-h=\"15-15\">لَنَسْفَعاَۢ بِالنَّاصِيَةِ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٦﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"17\" data-h=\"16-16\">نَاصِيَةࣲ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٧﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"18\" data-h=\"17-17\">فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٨﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"19\" data-h=\"18-18\">سَنَدْعُ ࡲ۬لزَّبَانِيَةَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٩﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"20\" data-h=\"19-19\">كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَاسْجُدْ وَاقْتَرِب <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٠﴾</span></span></div><p class=\"note\">📿 اضغط «استمع بصوت القارئ» أو على أي آية لتسمع التلاوة برواية قالون عن نافع.</p>"
